      "content": "it doesnt feel temporary though. it feels like a math problem. i calculate everything... the cost of my food, the cost of my health insurance, the way i just take up space and energy. when i add it all up, the numbers just say i'm a net loss. it feels like the most logical thing would be to just stop the drain.",
